WEBVTT

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.410
Will seeing me and talking...

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.410
resolve any of this?

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.000
Turning humans into vampires...

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.080
And if that's not bad enough,

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.250
you yourself changed from

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.250
a vampire to a human.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:38.290
What I sense beyond this door

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:38.290
is just an arrogant Pureblood

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.620
who tampers with humans.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.370
You're right, Zero.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.370
I'm glad you understand.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:50.330
The "Yuki" you know is gone.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:56.120
Because...that part of her was eaten up

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:56.120
by the Yuki which is a vampire.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:43.290
REVIVAL OF THE MAD EMPEROR

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.200
Your shoes...

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.200
I asked Ruka to bring them.

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:50.790
Hey!

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.410
For crying out loud!

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:57.370
This princess is a handful.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.080
Wait, Yuki Cross!

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:07.250
I mean, Lady Yuki!

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:07.250
You can't go around barefooted!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.290
Huh?!

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:12.950
Don't tell me you're hurt!

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:16.410
I thought I cut the sole of my foot.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.330
I thought for a moment

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.330
Lord Kaname would kill me!

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:25.160
Whatever!

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:25.160
Hurry up and put on your shoes!

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.290
I mean, please put on

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.290
your shoes, Lady Yuki.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:29.750
Oh...

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:31.870
Huh?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.790
I never expected you add "Lady"

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.790
before my name, Aido.

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:38.950
It feels sort of creepy.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:43.040
Just address me as you always have,

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:43.040
as "Yuki Cross" or "Hey you."

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.620
I'm very sorry I was rude all that time.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.290
In any case, wear these!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.290
I mean, please put them on.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.370
You must return to that room,

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.370
or Lord Kaname will be worried.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.290
I've never heard

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.290
of a Pureblood Princess

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.580
crying in front of people,

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.580
as you are now.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.040
If I am to be allowed to cry

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.040
only inside my heart...

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.580
That sound almost like a punishment.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.080
This is Ichijo and Shiki...

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.910
I should say, Lord Rido's

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.910
temporary residence.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:38.620
What do you want?

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:41.160
Ichiru Kiryu...

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.750
Will you open that casket?

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.870
You can choose to disobey.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.250
No...

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.040
You're alike, after all.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.580
The way you comply.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.660
Have I touched a nerve?

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:03.580
But it's the first time I've seen

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:03.580
the twins of a Hunter family alive.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.410
And since it's so rare, I...

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.040
When a woman from a Hunter family

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.040
becomes pregnant with twins,

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.250
it is not possible for both to survive.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:19.160
Driven only by instinct, the fetuses fight

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:19.160
to take over the other in the womb.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:25.620
Just like vampires sucking blood.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:33.040
Lady Shizuka said it was punishment

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:33.040
befitting of Hunters

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:37.450
because the ancestor of us Hunters

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:37.450
ate one of the original vampires.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.120
While it's a rare occurrence,

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:43.540
I heard one of the fetus sometime

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:43.540
steals the entire force of the other,

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:47.250
and a Hunter of enormous power

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:47.250
is born.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:52.250
But in your case, your other half

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:52.250
did not completely devour you.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:57.160
I guess he was indulgent

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:57.160
even before he was born.

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.660
There, the casket is open.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:08.080
I possess no power to stop you.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:08.080
Please do as you wish.

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.950
You want to destroy Lord Rido,

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.950
don't you?

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:14.330
Of course, you want to destroy him.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.580
You cut Lord Rido into

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.580
thousands of pieces

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:20.200
until no trace of

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:20.200
his original form was left.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.290
If you were able to overwhelm him

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.290
that much in the battle of Purebloods,

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.250
surely, you could have destroyed him

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.250
completely with just a bit more?

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.290
Yet, you didn't.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.700
Or rather, you couldn't?

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.830
True, if I had killed that man,

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.330
Shizuka's life may have

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.330
gone a different path.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:45.910
Now, Rido...

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:50.160
The moment you've waited

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:50.160
for so long is near!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.870
Vampires are selfish.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.830
Yuki is without a doubt

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.620
a Pureblood daughter

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.620
of the Kuran family.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.000
It's too late...

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.250
The "Yuki" you know is gone.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.500
Because...

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.870
Shut up!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.120
...that part of her was eaten up

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.120
by the Yuki which is a vampire.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.080
Go away!

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.330
Welcome back, Yagari.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.410
Depending on your business here,

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.410
I need you to leave immediately.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:49.870
I was away for a while, but this place

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:49.870
is filled with a sinister air now.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.660
Kill Zero Kiryu.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.580
That's the order given by

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.580
the Hunter's Society.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.580
You must be aware of that too.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.580
Correct?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:04.450
So you're here as the vanguard?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:08.080
And if I am?

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:11.830
I will show no mercy,

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:11.830
not even to you.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.830
If you allow Zero to stay here,

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.450
the Academy will

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.450
become a battleground.

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:19.750
Do you want that?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:23.290
I will protect...my son!

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:34.450
Humph... That look in your eyes...

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:34.450
It's the first time I've seen it.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:40.080
I value my life too much

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:40.080
to fight the legendary Hunter.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.080
Your complacency used to

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.080
irritate me to no end.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:48.040
But I'm glad I saw that just now.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:48.040
If you're willing to go that far...

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:50.410
Kiryu...

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:57.160
Did you come to kill me?

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:04.330
Sure, you have.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:04.330
I'm a vampire, after all.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.250
Fine.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.290
Do it.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.620
Kiryu!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.080
Kaname...

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:39.410
What are you...?!

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:42.330
Kaname...

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.950
Why are you in such a panic, Ichijo?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.450
It's all right.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:52.160
I can tear this man

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:52.160
into a thousand pieces,

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.450
but I can't deliver the final blow.

00:09:55.370 --> 00:10:00.450
And if that's the case, I figured I should

00:09:55.370 --> 00:10:00.450
just restore his true body as he wishes.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.870
Take it, Rido.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.370
It's what you craved

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.370
and lost your senses over...

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.330
The richest of Kuran blood.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:32.250
Juri... We've had more than

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:32.250
our share of life.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.580
It's been nearly 3,000 years

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.580
since you were born.

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:37.750
And we've been together

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:37.750
all that time.

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:40.200
I've been very happy.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:45.500
And after long and careful discussion,

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:45.500
we had a beautiful child.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.540
The proof of our love.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:52.200
Perhaps this is the right time.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:58.540
What you wanted for Yuki,

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:58.540
I'll agree to it now.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.540
Let us use our powers to choose

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.540
a different future for her.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.410
Yes, Haruka...

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.660
Then...I'll go on ahead.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:18.120
Kaname might scold us, though...

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:20.750
I wonder...

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:23.500
Like me, he's not very honest.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.120
You're very docile.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.080
After coming all the way here,

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.080
why hold back...

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.620
you dogs of the Senate?

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.700
I turned the ones who

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.700
came first into ash.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:49.120
You're under the wrong assumption,

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:49.120
Lord Haruka.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.080
We have nothing to do

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.080
with the Senate.

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.040
All we do is to serve Lord Rido.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.700
Why don't you cut out the bad acting

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.700
and be blunt about it?

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:02.620
That people like us who

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:02.620
don't conform are troublesome.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.080
That Rido and the Senate

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.080
have found common ground.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:09.700
Exactly...

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:17.200
Unlike you, who kept a distance

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:17.200
from the Senate,

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:21.580
I've always been

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:21.580
very friendly with them.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.160
You could not have been

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.160
unaware of it, so...

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.950
So, why did you

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.950
have the Senate

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.160
keep me in confinement

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.160
under their watch?

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:37.910
I just wanted to keep you

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:37.910
far away from me...and from Juri.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:42.250
Because you stole

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:42.250
our first child from us.

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:44.370
Oh that...

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:49.580
The child was essential in order for

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:49.580
my ultimate servant to be born.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.700
But it still isn't enough.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.410
You're so naive.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:13:00.790
At times like this, let your hatred rule

00:12:57.160 --> 00:13:00.790
and use your power!

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:04.620
Even an immortal Pureblood

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:04.620
can be tamed

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:06.200
if you crush his head or heart.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.250
And when that happens,

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.250
unless he receives

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:14.040
an even richer blood of a Pureblood,

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:14.040
he will not be able to revive so easily.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:17.540
Then my next blow

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:17.540
will be not to the belly,

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.000
but to the head and heart.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:23.790
I will not allow you

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:23.790
to resurrect, Brother.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.540
The rest of you go

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.540
and get the "Princess."

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:49.620
Now, devour your master.

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:04.200
I have been waiting

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:04.200
so long for this moment...

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.200
That sword...!

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:25.750
No, Father!

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:28.750
That sword belongs to the Hunters!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:30.540
Get back, Father!

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.200
Kaname...

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.080
I'm the one who must kill him.

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.080
It's my most important duty!

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:41.370
Do not let your hands be tainted by

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:41.370
the blood of this despicable coward!

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:47.830
A coward, who calls himself a vampire,

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:47.830
but wields a Hunter's weapon in a duel!

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.500
Kaname... You step back.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:01.250
A child protecting his parent?

00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:01.250
Do not take away a father's pride.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.160
You're wrong... Father...

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:07.200
Haruka, I...

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:09.330
It's all right.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.370
I understand everything.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:14.290
Haruka...

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.040
Did that sword pierce your heart?!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.120
Still...

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:24.160
You were always

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:24.160
our dear, precious son.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:44.660
Rido... Did Haruka take your head?

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:52.330
If I use this anti-vampire Hunter sword

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:52.330
to take away your rejuvenation powers,

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:55.080
that head wound would

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:55.080
become a fatal one.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.370
If I could, I do not want

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.370
such an easy death for you.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:05.830
But for Yuki's sake, I will make you

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:05.830
disappear now with this sword!

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.000
Huh?!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.500
Can't move your arm?

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.910
Are you still lost in euphoria?

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:23.620
You cannot kill me! Isn't that so?

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:28.200
No matter how much power you regain,

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:28.200
no matter how much you hurt me,

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.250
you cannot deliver a fatal blow!

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:33.870
After a thorough rest...

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:39.620
In order to make a full resurrection,

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:39.620
I shall return for rich Kuran blood.

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:44.750
And even at that time,

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:44.750
you will not be able to kill me.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.250
It feels so wonderful...

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.290
to be the one who put a leash

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.290
on the strongest monster!

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:57.120
It was my miscalculation that caused

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:57.120
someone like you to be born.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:05.160
I will make sure to find the means

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:05.160
to destroy you by the time you return.

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:09.620
Until then...stay meek and quiet.

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:13.290
Everything is for that moment.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:15.700
Kaname...

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.040
Why did he say, "not able to kill"?

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:24.040
No, never mind.

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:24.040
I could care less about this man's life.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:27.250
Kaname, why do you...

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:32.330
Why do you Purebloods

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:32.330
act so recklessly?!

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:35.410
Huh?!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.120
Fine.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:43.040
You don't care about

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:43.040
being understood, do you?

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.750
Even though that makes me sad.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.660
I put blood directly into him,

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:55.540
so he won't be needing

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:55.540
a host body the following night.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:01.330
The ability to revive

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:01.330
even from this condition.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.500
Purebloods are repulsive,

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.500
aren't they?

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:09.910
If your head or heart is stabbed,

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:09.910
or if your head is chopped off,

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.370
you could turn to dust, right?

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:13.790
Kaname...

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.250
Your desire to kill Rido

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.250
hasn't changed...

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:28.700
Yet you said you "can't" kill Rido.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.330
Why is that?

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:36.120
Because I am,

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:36.120
the progenitor of Kurans...

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:42.160
and Rido was my master

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:42.160
who awakened me from my coffin.

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.790
It is only a matter of time

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.790
before Lord Rido awakens

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.790
after receiving Kuran blood.

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:56.200
After that, we will have him

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:56.200
replace Lord Kaname

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:58.500
as the head of the Kuran family.

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:04.620
And that will increase

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:04.620
the powers of the Senate.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:12.040
The only concern is the presence

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:12.040
of the Hunters in that academy.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.250
What is there to be concerned about?

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:20.410
I can understand if Lord Rido

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:20.410
is an average vampire.

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:23.700
He has been alive

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:23.700
far longer than I have,

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.620
but he is still a child.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:30.950
Hence, I do not know

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:30.950
what he is thinking.

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:36.370
For what reason would he keep

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:36.370
one half of Kiryu's twins as a servant?

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:43.700
The reason is probably very trivial.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:43.700
Like he was bored...

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:45.910
Pardon me for saying that.

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:54.040
However, there is no need to worry

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:54.040
about the other twin either, Ichio.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:20:02.040
Zero... He was born as the other twin

00:19:55.040 --> 00:20:02.040
to a known Hunter family Kiryu,

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.450
but he was changed into a vampire

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:07.040
and has received the blood

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:07.040
of the Kuran princess.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.910
I did think that he could be

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.910
of use to us, but...

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:17.040
I don't think he will be obedient.

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:22.660
So the Hunters have been instructed

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:22.660
to eliminate him as a dangerous vampire.

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.330
By my order.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:38.620
It's a long night...

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:49.290
What're you getting so worked up for?

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:49.290
You fool!

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.370
Who do you think I am?

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.660
If I intended to hunt you,

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.660
I'd have done it long ago.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:02.120
The Hunter's Society President

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:02.120
and the Senate are in cahoots.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:05.790
The Hunter's Society, this Academy...

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.830
This world is rotten.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:13.830
I intend to keep killing vampires.

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:15.870
Other than you.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.580
If you're gonna waste time

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.580
being sentimental,

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.700
then stay here and clear your head.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:24.250
And figure out a solution.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:26.750
I'll just say one thing to you.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:29.750
You are not a vampire.

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:31.910
You are a Vampire Hunter.

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:51.160
The "Yuki" you know is gone.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.790
Because...that part of her was eaten up

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.790
by the Yuki which is a vampire.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:03.330
Zero!

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:05.160
Shut up!

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.370
Two pulses...both alike.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:17.580
I can feel two existences

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:17.580
deep within me...resonating.

00:22:20.500 --> 00:22:23.250
I cannot think rationally.

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:04.040
Next time:

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:04.040
"Prelude to the Battle"
